  "body": "Tucked away in a sought-after Milford location, this charming solid-brick home delivers something increasingly hard to find — generous living space, a truly substantial north-facing backyard, and easy-care single-level living.\r\n\r\nStep inside and you’ll immediately appreciate the sense of space. The open-plan living, dining and kitchen creates a warm and practical hub for everyday life, with a living area that feels surprisingly spacious — noticeably larger than what you would typically expect from a two-bedroom unit.\r\n\r\nThe kitchen connects effortlessly to the outdoors, opening to a level, fully fenced and north-facing backyard. Bigger than many unit or cross-lease outdoor areas, this is a wonderful private space for summer barbecues, entertaining friends, children to play, or simply enjoying a sunny afternoon at home.\r\n\r\nThere are two comfortable bedrooms, a well-appointed shower room and the added convenience of a separate toilet. Recently refreshed with fresh interior paint and new flooring, the home is ready for its new owners to simply move in, relax and enjoy.\r\n\r\nThe solid-brick exterior provides a reassuring sense of permanence, while a single garage plus a separate storage room at the rear adds valuable practicality for vehicles, tools, bikes and all those extras of everyday life.\r\n\r\nA Location That Makes Life Easy\r\nPositioned in popular Milford, you’ll enjoy the convenience of being close to local shops, cafés, restaurants, beaches and everyday amenities, while retaining easy access to Takapuna and the wider North Shore. The North Shore hospital is within walking distance, and The Smiles Farm Main bus stop is only minutes away. \r\n\r\nFamilies will appreciate the excellent schooling options in the area, with Milford School, Takapuna Normal Intermediate, Westlake Boys’ High School and Westlake Girls’ High School among the key schools associated with the locality.\r\n\r\nWith its combination of space, sunshine, solid construction, a generous backyard and an outstanding Milford location, this is a home that offers far more than you might expect from a two-bedroom unit.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re a first-home buyer, downsizer, professional couple or savvy investor, 3/21 Thornton Road deserves to be at the top of your viewing list.",
